    "devices_off_2": "<style>p{text-align: left;}</style><p style='width:1000px;'>You must pay full attention for the next 30-40 minutes, so please: <br>  (1) <strong>mute all notifications and close open tabs</strong> (to make sure the survey doesn't reload and go back to the first page!!);<br>(2) sit comfortably;<br>  (3) wear glasses or contact lenses if you use them; <br> (4) make sure keyboard and mouse controls work. <br> <br> Pages time out after some time, so please move through quickly where possible.</p>",

